{{Documentation/Header}}
This template is used to mark templates as high-risk, a template that has a lot of uses and where technically deficient or malicious edits can affect almost every page on the wiki. Templates marked as such will be put in [[:Category:High-Risk Templates]], and modules [[:Category:High-Risk Modules]].

==Syntax==
{{T|High Risk|v1=Template or Module name with specified namespace|v2=pagetype=Namespace the template/module is designed for|v3=nocat=include as "1" to disable categories}}
* {{F|pagetype}} &mdash; Main, Template, File, Module or Category.

==Examples==
{{T|High Risk|Template:Utaite|pagetype=Main|nocat=1|_Y_=1}}

==Template Data==
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"label": "Name",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Template or Module full name with specified namespace of which to use for the statistics.",
			"example": "\"Module:Round\", \"Template:Card\"",
			"default": "{{NAMESPACE}}:{{ROOTPAGENAME}}",
			"suggested": true
		},
		"pagetype": {
			"label": "Page Type",
			"description": "Namespace which the template/module is designed for.",
